  "2026-10-03T08:17:29.465Z","harness:codex","TDD baseline: reproduced the report against 2026.10.2 in isolated temporary trackers. Added tests/integration/agent-receipt-recovery.integration.spec.ts; all five independent contract tests fail before implementation at the reported behavior (validation attribution, equivalent JSON error selectors, executable handoff restore, inherited leaf options, canonical compact short-ID compositions). No domain mocks or live tracker access in tests. Related batch GH-1365 through GH-1369 shares SDK-owned agent context contracts; existing closed compact receipt lineage is preserved."
  "2026-10-03T08:41:25.912Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: focused isolated suite passes 209 tests. Manual clean npm installation of the packed artifact passed 46 commands under Node and Bun: short-ID claim/start, full opt-in preserving an 18,000-character description, both JSON selectors for validation and missing IDs, inherited-option refusals, executable orient/handoff section recovery, pause/close, and verified immutable history. npx/bunx packed acceptance independently passed all nine package workflows plus TypeScript SDK consumers. No coverage or lint threshold changed; repository-wide static/coverage runs are still pending."
  "2026-10-03T09:12:38.243Z","harness:codex","Canonical full-suite rerun passed 9636 tests with two Windows-only skips, but an existing packed SDK continuation test timed out in its 30-second npm pack subprocess under concurrent host load. It had independently passed 39815ms end-to-end in the repaired focused suite. This is not a full coverage pass: no coverage summary was generated after the test failure. Retrying the complete unchanged assertions with bounded worker concurrency and no parallel packaging; no threshold, timeout or test exclusion is changed."
  "2026-10-03T09:34:09.444Z","harness:codex","Repository-wide verification: 9637 tests passed (the two Windows-only tests are platform-skipped on Linux), with exact coverage and zero uncovered counts: statements 66524/66524, branches 50886/50886, functions 13745/13745, lines 63433/63433. pnpm typecheck passed. Native pm test-all for the five active items passed, executing their shared public suite once and explicitly suppressing duplicate linked commands. The clean packed manual harness passed 52 Node/Bun commands; npx/bunx acceptance passed nine workflows. Gate thresholds, assertions, subprocess timeouts and coverage exclusions were not relaxed; the new ancestor-option implementation was moved outside the pre-existing c8 exclusion so its branches are measured. Hosted review remains pending."
  "2026-10-03T09:34:10.499Z","harness:codex","Recurrence governance: the new recurs_from link to closed pm-eqdo85 exposed an unregistered component. Registered canonical-ownership-composition-receipts with that historical seed and real CLI/MCP/SDK receipt checks; all 167 recorded recurrence members are now covered. The disconnected-lineage negative control still exits 1 with the expected two findings, while the real defect-evidence gate passes. Preserved the typed recurrence edge and gate enforcement rather than removing either."
  "2026-10-03T09:45:57.794Z","harness:codex","Final local delivery evidence: all mandatory static stages passed after registering the recurrence family and exact CLI refusal inventory. The original gate refusals remain in evidence; no waiver, threshold, ignore marker or assertion was weakened. The unchanged source coverage remains exact 100 percent. Closure is staged with structured evidence for the combined reviewed delivery; broader graph and semantic docstring debt retain their open canonical owners."
